  displayName: Sagittarius MBT
  role: 2
  description: 'The ISF''s main battle tank and one of the hardest targets on the
    field: 20 health and Armor Level 4 shrug off rifles, machine guns, grenades and
    flamethrowers alike. Its 100mm Cannon (10 damage, penetration 4, 50 m) can crack
    other heavy armor, but it''s Manual Load: one shot a turn. It can also throw
    a Frag Grenade every turn. It moves a long way (30 m) but, being Mechanical,
    can''t sprint. When destroyed it has a 10% chance to explode (Unstable), so keep
    your own soldiers clear of it. Heavy Support, so you can field more than one.'
